  "title": "SOC report selection",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>SOC report selection</h2><p>Match assurance needs to reports and identify a coverage limitation.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m3-tbs1-f1\">Report family for A</label><select id=\"isc-m3-tbs1-f1\"><option value=\"SOC 1\">SOC 1</option><option value=\"Only SOC 3\">Only SOC 3</option><option value=\"A tax return\">A tax return</option><option value=\"A marketing brochure\">A marketing brochure</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m3-tbs1-f2\">Report family for B</label><select id=\"isc-m3-tbs1-f2\"><option value=\"SOC 2\">SOC 2</option><option value=\"Only a financial statement compilation\">Only a financial statement compilation</option><option value=\"An income-tax opinion\">An income-tax opinion</option><option value=\"No assurance report can address controls\">No assurance report can address controls</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m3-tbs1-f3\">Report family for C</label><select id=\"isc-m3-tbs1-f3\"><option value=\"SOC 3\">SOC 3</option><option value=\"Only a restricted detailed workpaper\">Only a restricted detailed workpaper</option><option value=\"A payroll register\">A payroll register</option><option value=\"A stock certificate\">A stock certificate</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m3-tbs1-f4\">Limitation of the supplied Type 1 report</label><select id=\"isc-m3-tbs1-f4\"><option value=\"It does not establish full-year operating effectiveness\">It does not establish full-year operating effectiveness</option><option value=\"It automatically covers every day of the year\">It automatically covers every day of the year</option><option value=\"It guarantees no exceptions\">It guarantees no exceptions</option><option value=\"Its receipt date extends its scope\">Its receipt date extends its scope</option></select></div></section>",
